WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.401
Not wanting to put a damper
on Rhea's celebrations

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:03.903
or anything, but it's time
we killed her dead.

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:05.705
Smash her skull in with a rock.

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:06.806
-Nice!
-KENDALL ROY: Okay.

00:00:06.872 --> 00:00:08.141
Way to ease us in, sis.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.209
Will there be nibbles at this
event? I was expecting nibbles.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:13.546
What I'm thinking is,
we just-- we tell him direct.

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:15.849
We just tell him, all of us,
we won't have it.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.284
-Should I maybe take the floor?
-SHIV ROY: Okay.

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:21.120
Would Rhea really be
the worst thing in the world?

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:24.256
Or does a woman from outside
actually make sense right now?

00:00:24.523 --> 00:00:27.693
(SCOFFS) Okay, right, well,
she-- she got to you.

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:31.263
No. Just, I'm fighting
on two fronts,

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:33.199
and I may have to make
a request to Dad

00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:35.701
about a bridge situation,
and she's been understanding.

00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:37.070
This is bullshit.
Ken?

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:40.540
-Well...
-Well? Oh, come on.

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:43.576
Oh, she-- You're backing
her too, rebounder?

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:44.744
No, I-- I just...

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:48.180
I just think that maybe you've
overplayed your hand.

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:50.216
Excuse me?
How did she get to you?

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.852
Oh, you think that you'll
be given another shot,

00:00:52.918 --> 00:00:54.654
at some point, ever?
No.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.957
-And Roman, you? No.
-Uh, well, I mean...

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.260
No, she thinks you're a dipshit,
or maybe you're just

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.594
too much of a fucking dipshit
to see that.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:03.429
Fuck you. I know more
about this business than you.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:04.464
More than any of you, actually.

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.799
Roman, no one gives a fuck
about management training.

00:01:06.865 --> 00:01:07.934
Dad does, Gerri does.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.068
It's corporate daycare.

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:10.903
-(MIMICS SHIV)
-(KENDALL LAUGHS)

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:13.472
That's not a good retort.
Don't fucking laugh at that.

00:01:13.539 --> 00:01:15.174
-Shiv...
-Thanks for taking this
seriously.

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:18.644
-I do.
-It's just... it's transparent.

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:19.846
-Uh?
-KENDALL: You know...

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:22.648
...Rhea's who Dad wants,
clearly.

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:24.250
-So--
-But he's wrong.

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:25.551
-Yeah, but--
-In case you want it in writing.

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:27.553
Maybe, you know,
you should just like--

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:28.954
like, give it up.

00:01:29.421 --> 00:01:31.924
Full disclosure,
I'm starting to like her.

00:01:32.191 --> 00:01:33.559
Aww, he likes her!

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:35.394
Yeah, this is why you don't
hatch a plan with Connor,

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:36.462
the first fucking pancake.

00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:39.598
First pancake. Okay, thank you.
You're a brat.

00:01:39.698 --> 00:01:41.000
You know, none of you
have been through

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:42.268
what I've been through,
so just--

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.504
Aww, my mommy got sent
to the booby hatch

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:45.604
and now I'm sad.

00:01:45.671 --> 00:01:46.505
Fuck off.

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:48.707
Think you're being too emotional
about this whole thing.

00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:50.243
Oh, my fucking God!

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.245
Are you doing the emotional card
on me?

00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:54.480
-Fuck's sake.
-I mean...

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.549
I mean I was gonna mansplain
it to you,

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:58.418
but I think he did
a very good job.

